{"title":"Dimensional Drawings of Apple Products","link":"https://kottke.org/26/09/dimensional-drawings-of-apple-products","date":1790091840000,"content":"\n         \t<p>So that companies can use them to make accessories like cases and bands, Apple maintains <a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/accessories/dimensional-drawings\">a collection of downloadable dimensional drawings and tech specifications</a> for many of their products, including the iPhone, AirPods, Watch, and iPad. They are beautiful.</p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1790066927-10abca28.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1790066927-10abca28.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1790066927-10abca28.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1790066906-ffe63f63.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1790066906-ffe63f63.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1790066906-ffe63f63.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1790066907-24b67024.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1790066907-24b67024.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1790066907-24b67024.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1790066907-72db16ca.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1790066907-72db16ca.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1790066907-72db16ca.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p>I love their corner &amp; edge measurements…you can see how fiddly Apple is with their curves. Curiously, the only Mac listed is the Macbook Neo. I guess that’s the only one that needs accessorizing?</p>\n\t<p>Also, I presume if you’ve got a 3D printer, you could use these to make your own very precise accessories?\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Apple\">Apple</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/design\">design</a></p>\n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"c183e18a64b7b61cf8bb86f9d764d6145f2bbf9a071dd10b8f88f59b28e4411e","category":"Sites"}